              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakadiye utendelela mu nsubu wa Niseloka, nzambi wandi, Adalameleke ne Shalese, bana bandi balume, bakamushiha ne muele wa nvita, bakanyema mu buloba bua Alalata. Esâ-hadona muanʼandi wakakokesha mu muaba wandi.",
